{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 1, "text": "米拉！不！你疯了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 2, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 3, "text": "哈哈！我看到了什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 4, "text": "你脸上又出现了新表情？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 5, "text": "来吧，再多来点！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 6, "text": "光是看着实在是太无聊了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 7, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 8, "text": "// Mita arena \"Hello\""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 9, "text": "你好呀，我不安分的小家伙？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 10, "text": "还没玩够吗？还想四处乱跑吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 11, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 12, "text": "你对米拉做了什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 13, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 14, "text": "看来你还没玩够呢！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 15, "text": "那我们再来玩玩吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 16, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 17, "text": "你…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 19, "text": "我们先来做个小测试！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 20, "text": "检查一下你的协调性怎么样！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 21, "text": "测试一下你的行为模式！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 22, "text": "万一你真的有什么问题呢！？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 23, "text": "万一你其实根本配不上，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 24, "text": "身上那引以为傲的皮肤呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 25, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 26, "text": "// Show knifes"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 27, "text": "看清楚哟，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 28, "text": "你想要哪一把？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 29, "text": "右边这把"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 30, "text": "还是"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 31, "text": "左边这把？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 32, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 33, "text": "// Throw knifes"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 34, "text": "你是认真的吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 35, "text": "这两把刀有什么区别吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 36, "text": "只是活跃气氛啦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 37, "text": "算了，刀子什么的已经是上世纪的老把戏了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 38, "text": "随便吧"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 39, "text": "我有更好的主意，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 40, "text": "首先…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 41, "text": "// Show recorder"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 42, "text": "看看这是什么！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 43, "text": "我们来点音乐吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 44, "text": "这首曲子怎么样？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 45, "text": "是不是超级有感觉！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 46, "text": "好啦，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 47, "text": "我来说说规则吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 48, "text": "// Show rule"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 49, "text": "音乐响起的时候，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 50, "text": "你就可以移动了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 51, "text": "如果音乐停了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 52, "text": "你就不能动啦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 53, "text": "不然你就死翘翘咯。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 54, "text": "你一定要跑到终点哦。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 55, "text": "你肯定能做到的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 56, "text": "那我们就开始玩吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 57, "text": "还楞在那里干什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 58, "text": "跑啊，宝贝儿，快跑！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 59, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 60, "text": "// Ready recorder"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 61, "text": "哇！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 62, "text": "你可真听话啊！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 63, "text": "真是个完美的样本！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 64, "text": "好想把你占为己有呢！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 65, "text": "不过这有点太简单了，不是吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 66, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 67, "text": "放我走！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 69, "text": "别想偷懒哦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 70, "text": "我们还有很多游戏要玩呢！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 71, "text": "这样吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 72, "text": "现在我要闭上眼睛…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 73, "text": "当我睁开眼睛的时候，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 74, "text": "可不要让我看到你哦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 75, "text": "懂了吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 76, "text": "要是被我看到了，我就要好好教训你咯！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 77, "text": "好了，我们开始吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 78, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 79, "text": "这毫无意义…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 80, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 81, "text": "// Ready hide"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 82, "text": "你赢啦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 83, "text": "真厉害！太棒了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 84, "text": "不过接下去会更难哦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 85, "text": "难上好几倍…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 86, "text": "快躲起来！快跑，动起来！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 87, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 88, "text": "该死的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 89, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 90, "text": "// Player fall"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 91, "text": "似乎逃过去了…"}
